      still applied (seen in screenshots); overlay minimap persistence untouched

## Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|------------|
| Saved bounds point at a removed monitor → window opens off-screen | Medium | Visibility check against the virtual screen; fallback to defaults |
| Corrupt/hand-edited settings value breaks startup | Low | Parse/validate defensively; any failure falls back to defaults |
| Hard process kill skips the close-time save | Low | Accepted — same tradeoff as the overlay; at worst one session's adjustment is lost |

